{"unit_id": "tag:01WC:statement", "translation": "局部射影态射（projective morphism）是固有的（proper）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射", "context": "描述具有局部射影性的态射"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的", "context": "结论中的态射性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01WC:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是局部射影的（projective）。为证明<MATH_0002>是固有的（proper），可以在基底（base）上局部地进行，见引理<REF_0001>。因此，由上面的引理<REF_0002>，可以假设存在闭浸入（closed immersion）<MATH_0003>。\n由引理<REF_0003>和<REF_0004>，只需证明<MATH_0004>是固有的（proper）。由于<MATH_0005>是<MATH_0006>的基变换（base change），只需证明<MATH_0007>是固有的（proper），见引理<REF_0005>。\n由《构造（Constructions）》中的引理<REF_0006>，概形（scheme）<MATH_0008>是分离的（separated）。由《构造（Constructions）》中的引理<REF_0007>，概形（scheme）<MATH_0009>是拟紧的（quasi-compact）。显然，<MATH_0010>是局部有限型的（locally of finite type），因为<MATH_0011>由仿射开集（affine opens）<MATH_0012>覆盖，其中每个都是有限型（finite type）<MATH_0013>-代数（algebra）<MATH_0014>的谱（spectrum）。\n最后，还须证明<MATH_0015>是泛闭的（universally closed）。这由《构造（Constructions）》中的引理<REF_0008>和赋值准则（valuative criterion）推出（见《概形（Schemes）》中的命题<REF_0009>）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型的"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "泛闭的"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造"}, {"source_term": "valuative criterion", "target_term": "赋值准则"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "局部性假设中的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的", "context": "首先要证明的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底", "context": "在其上局部论证的目标"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "归约后假设存在的浸入"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的", "context": "第一次归约所得的待证性质"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "连接两个态射的构造"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的", "context": "基变换归约所得的待证性质"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造", "context": "引用分离性引理所在的篇名"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "考察分离性的对象"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的", "context": "由第一条构造引理得到的性质"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造", "context": "引用拟紧性引理所在的篇名"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "考察拟紧性的对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的", "context": "由第二条构造引理得到的性质"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型的", "context": "从仿射开覆盖得出的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "给定覆盖中的开集"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "仿射开集所对应代数的性质"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "在指定系数环上的代数"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱", "context": "从代数得到仿射概形的构造"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "泛闭的", "context": "最后须验证的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造", "context": "最后一条构造引理所在的篇名"}, {"source_term": "valuative criterion", "target_term": "赋值准则", "context": "用来推出泛闭性的准则"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "赋值准则所在的篇名"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0B5N:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的固有态射（proper morphism）。若存在一个<MATH_0002>-丰沛（ample）的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf），且该层定义在<MATH_0003>上，则<MATH_0004>是局部射影的（projective）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "proper morphism", "target_term": "固有态射"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源与目标"}, {"source_term": "proper morphism", "target_term": "固有态射", "context": "引理所假设的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛", "context": "带指定参数的层的性质"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "修饰所假设的层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "假设存在的对象"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "结论中的局部态射性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0B5N:proof", "translation": "若存在<MATH_0001>-丰沛（ample）的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf），则可以在<MATH_0002>上局部地找到一个浸入（immersion）<MATH_0003>，见引理<REF_0001>。由于<MATH_0004>是固有的（proper），态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>是闭浸入（closed immersion），见引理<REF_0002>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛", "context": "带指定参数的层的性质"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "修饰所假设的层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "假设存在的对象"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "局部构造出的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的", "context": "用来判定闭浸入的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "被证明是闭浸入的箭头"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "所得态射的类型"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01WE:statement", "translation": "H-射影（projective）态射（morphisms）的复合（composition）是H-射影的（projective）。\n", "allowed_english": ["H-"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "原文 H-projective 中的性质词"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "参与复合的箭头"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "组合态射的运算"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "结论中 H-projective 的性质词"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01WE:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>与<MATH_0002>都是H-射影的（projective）。则存在闭浸入（closed immersions）<MATH_0003>（在<MATH_0004>上）和<MATH_0005>（在<MATH_0006>上）。\n考虑如下图（diagram）\n<MATH_0007>\n其中，最上方最靠右的水平（horizontal）箭头（arrow）是塞格雷嵌入（Segre embedding），见《构造（Constructions）》中的引理<REF_0001>。从图（diagram）可见，<MATH_0008>可视为<MATH_0009>的闭子概形（closed subscheme），这正是所要证明的。\n", "allowed_english": ["H-"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}, {"source_term": "closed immersions", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "horizontal", "target_term": "水平"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头"}, {"source_term": "Segre embedding", "target_term": "塞格雷嵌入"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "两个态射的 H-射影性假设"}, {"source_term": "closed immersions", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "用以表示两个态射的浸入"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "列出相关态射的图"}, {"source_term": "horizontal", "target_term": "水平", "context": "定位图中的指定箭头"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头", "context": "图中表示态射的箭头"}, {"source_term": "Segre embedding", "target_term": "塞格雷嵌入", "context": "图右上方的嵌入"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造", "context": "引用嵌入引理所在的篇名"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "用来识别闭子概形的图"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "图所确定的子概形类型"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01WF:statement", "translation": "H-射影态射（projective morphism）的基变换（base change）是H-射影的（projective）。\n", "allowed_english": ["H-"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射", "context": "基变换前的 H-射影态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "对给定态射实施的构造"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "基变换后保持的 H-射影性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01WF:proof", "translation": "这是因为，概形（scheme）上的射影（projective）空间（space）经基变换（base change）后仍是射影（projective）空间（space），而闭浸入（closed immersion）经基变换（base change）后仍是闭浸入（closed immersion），见《概形（Schemes）》中的引理<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "射影空间的基底"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "修饰基变换前的空间"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间", "context": "基变换前的对象"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "对射影空间实施的构造"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "修饰基变换后的空间"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间", "context": "基变换后得到的对象"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "基变换前的浸入类型"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "对闭浸入实施的构造"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "基变换后的浸入类型"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引用基变换引理所在的篇名"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02V6:statement", "translation": "（局部）射影态射（projective morphism）的基变换（base change）是（局部）射影的（projective）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射", "context": "基变换前的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "对给定态射实施的构造"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "基变换后保持的态射性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02V6:proof", "translation": "这是因为，概形（scheme）上的射影（projective）丛（bundle）经基变换（base change）后仍是射影（projective）丛（bundle），有限型（finite type）<MATH_0001>-模（module）的拉回（pullback）是有限型的（finite type）（《模（Modules）》中的引理<REF_0001>），并且闭浸入（closed immersion）经基变换（base change）后仍是闭浸入（closed immersion），见《概形（Schemes）》中的引理<REF_0002>。略去部分细节。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "bundle", "target_term": "丛"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "bundle", "target_term": "丛"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型的"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "射影丛的基底"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "修饰基变换前的丛"}, {"source_term": "bundle", "target_term": "丛", "context": "基变换前的对象"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "对射影丛实施的构造"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "修饰基变换后的丛"}, {"source_term": "bundle", "target_term": "丛", "context": "基变换后得到的对象"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "被拉回的模的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "拉回操作的对象"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "对给定模实施的操作"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型的", "context": "拉回所得模的性质"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "引用拉回引理所在的篇名"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "基变换前的浸入类型"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "对闭浸入实施的构造"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "基变换后的浸入类型"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引用基变换引理所在的篇名"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:07RL:statement", "translation": "射影态射（projective morphism）是拟射影的（quasi-projective）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射", "context": "引理中的出发对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影的", "context": "引理断言的结论"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:07RL:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是射影态射（projective morphism）。选取一个闭浸入（closed immersion）<MATH_0002>，其中<MATH_0003>是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的有限型（finite type）<MATH_0004>-模（module）。于是<MATH_0005>是<MATH_0006>-很丰沛的（very ample）。\n由于<MATH_0007>是固有的（proper）（引理<REF_0001>），它是拟紧的（quasi-compact）。因此，由引理<REF_0002>，<MATH_0008>是<MATH_0009>-丰沛的（ample）。由于<MATH_0010>是固有的（proper），它是有限型的（finite type）。\n这样就验证了拟射影（quasi-projective）定义中的所有性质，证明完毕。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "very ample", "target_term": "很丰沛的"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛的"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射", "context": "证明所假设的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "由射影性选取的浸入"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "所选模的性质"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "对所选模的有限性要求"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "射影构造所用的模"}, {"source_term": "very ample", "target_term": "很丰沛的", "context": "由闭浸入得到的相对性质"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的", "context": "用以推出拟紧性的性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的", "context": "从固有性得出的性质"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛的", "context": "由所引引理得到的相对性质"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的", "context": "用以推出有限型的性质"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型的", "conte