{"unit_id": "tag:01WA:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是H-拟射影（quasi-projective）态射（morphism）。则<MATH_0002>可分解（factors）为<MATH_0003>，其中<MATH_0004>是开浸入（open immersion），且<MATH_0005>是H-射影的（projective）。\n", "allowed_english": ["H-"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "factors", "target_term": "分解"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影", "context": "H-拟射影态射的性质词"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "要分解的箭头"}, {"source_term": "factors", "target_term": "分解", "context": "将态射写为两个箭头的复合"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "分解中的浸入类型"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "分解中另一态射的 H-射影性"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01WA:proof", "translation": "按定义，可将<MATH_0001>分解（factor）为先作拟紧（quasi-compact）浸入（immersion）<MATH_0002>，再作投影（projection）<MATH_0003>。由引理<REF_0001>，存在闭子概形（closed subscheme）<MATH_0004>，使得<MATH_0005>经由开浸入（open immersion）<MATH_0006>分解（factors through）。引理得证。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "factor", "target_term": "分解"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "factors through", "target_term": "分解"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "factor", "target_term": "分解", "context": "按定义把给定态射写成复合"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "分解中第一个箭头的性质"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "分解中第一个箭头的类型"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影", "context": "分解中后作的箭头"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "由所引引理取得的对象"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "指定分解所经过的箭头类型"}, {"source_term": "factors through", "target_term": "分解", "context": "给定态射经由所指定的开浸入分解"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:07RM:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是拟射影（quasi-projective）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0002>既拟紧（quasi-compact）又拟分离（quasi-separated）。则<MATH_0003>可分解（factors）为<MATH_0004>，其中<MATH_0005>是开浸入（open immersion），且<MATH_0006>是射影的（projective）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "factors", "target_term": "分解"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影", "context": "给定态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "待作分解的箭头"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "对给定对象的首个假设"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "对同一对象的第二个假设"}, {"source_term": "factors", "target_term": "分解", "context": "将给定态射写为两个箭头的复合"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "分解中的浸入类型"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "分解中另一态射的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:07RM:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>-丰沛的（ample）。由于<MATH_0003>是有限型的（finite type），且<MATH_0004>是拟紧的（quasi-compact），<MATH_0005>是<MATH_0006>-很丰沛的（very ample），此结论对某个<MATH_0007>成立，见引理<REF_0001>。将<MATH_0008>替换为<MATH_0009>。\n记<MATH_0010>。这是一个拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0011>-模（module），见《概形（Schemes）》中的引理<REF_0002>（拟射影（quasi-projective）态射（morphisms）是拟紧（quasi-compact）且分离的（separated），见引理<REF_0003>）。由《性质（Properties）》中的引理<REF_0004>，可找到一个有向集（directed set）<MATH_0012>和一个有限型（finite type）拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0013>-模（modules）系<MATH_0014>，该系以<MATH_0015>为指标，且满足<MATH_0016>。\n考虑下列复合（compositions）\n<MATH_0017>。\n选取一个有限（finite）仿射开集（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0018>。对每个<MATH_0019>，可选取截面（sections）\n<MATH_0020>，\n使它们生成（generate）<MATH_0021>（在<MATH_0022>上），并定义一个浸入（immersion）\n<MATH_0023>，\n见引理<REF_0005>。\n选取<MATH_0024>，使得存在截面（sections）<MATH_0025>映到（mapping to）<MATH_0026>（在<MATH_0027>中），且对所有<MATH_0028>和<MATH_0029>均可如此选取。于是映射（map）<MATH_0030>是满射（surjective），因为截面（sections）<MATH_0031>与截面（sections）<MATH_0032>具有相同的像（image），而后者生成（generate）<MATH_0033>。\n由此得到一个态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0034>，\n它在<MATH_0035>上，并且在<MATH_0036>上，上述浸入（immersion）有分解（factorization）\n<MATH_0037>。因此<MATH_0038>是浸入（immersion），见引理<REF_0006>。由于<MATH_0039>，可得<MATH_0040>是浸入（immersion）。\n注意，<MATH_0041>是拟紧的（quasi-compact），因为<MATH_0042>是拟紧的（quasi-compact），且<MATH_0043>是分离的（separated）（见《概形（Schemes）》中的引理<REF_0007>）。\n由引理<REF_0008>，存在闭子概形（closed subscheme）<MATH_0044>，使得<MATH_0045>经由开浸入（open immersion）<MATH_0046>分解（factors through）。于是按定义，<MATH_0047>是射影的（projective），证明完毕。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛的"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的"}, {"source_term": "very ample", "target_term": "很丰沛的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "tar