{"unit_id": "tag:0BCL:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003>是射影的（projective），当且仅当<MATH_0004>是拟射影（quasi-projective）且固有的（proper）；\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0005>是H-射影的（projective），当且仅当<MATH_0006>是H-拟射影（quasi-projective）且固有的（proper）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": ["H-"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "对给定概形的第一项限制"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "对给定概形的第二项限制"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理开头所给的对象"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的源与目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理所考察的箭头"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "第一条等价命题的左侧性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影", "context": "第一条等价命题右侧的第一项性质"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的", "context": "第一条等价命题右侧的第二项性质"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "第二条等价命题左侧 H-射影的性质词"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影", "context": "第二条等价命题右侧 H-拟射影的性质词"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的", "context": "第二条等价命题右侧的第二项性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0BCL:proof", "translation": "若<MATH_0001>是射影的（projective），则<MATH_0002>由引理<REF_0001>是拟射影的（quasi-projective），由引理<REF_0002>是固有的（proper）。反之，若<MATH_0003>是拟射影（quasi-projective）且固有的（proper），则可选取开浸入（open immersion）<MATH_0004>，使<MATH_0005>是射影的（projective），见引理<REF_0003>。\n由于<MATH_0006>是固有的（proper），<MATH_0007>在<MATH_0008>中是闭的（closed）（引理<REF_0004>），即<MATH_0009>是（开（open）且）闭浸入（closed immersion）。\n由于<MATH_0010>同构（isomorphic）于一个射影（projective）丛（bundle）的闭子概形（closed subscheme）（该丛在<MATH_0011>上，见定义<REF_0005>），同样的结论对<MATH_0012>也成立，即<MATH_0013>是射影态射（projective morphism）。这证明了（1）。\n（2）的证明相同，只是使用引理<REF_0006>和<REF_0007>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影的"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭的"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "bundle", "target_term": "丛"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "正向推理的假设"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影的", "context": "第一条引理给出的性质"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的", "context": "第二条引理给出的性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影", "context": "逆向推理的第一项假设"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的", "context": "逆向推理的第二项假设"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "逆向推理中选取的箭头"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "与开浸入一起取得的性质"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的", "context": "用于推出像为闭集的性质"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭的", "context": "指定对象在其环境中的性质"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "括注中同时成立的浸入性质"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "由闭性得到的箭头类型"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "与闭子概形的关系"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "修饰包含闭子概形的丛"}, {"source_term": "bundle", "target_term": "丛", "context": "包含闭子概形的对象"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "同构关系的另一端"}, {"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射", "context": "逆向推理得到的态射类型"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0C4P:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphisms）。若<MATH_0003>是拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离的（quasi-separated），且<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>都是射影的（projective），则<MATH_0006>是射影的（projective）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所给态射的源与目标"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理中所给的两个箭头"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "所给对象的第一项假设"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的", "context": "同一对象的第二项假设"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "两个给定态射共同具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "引理结论中的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0C4P:proof", "translation": "由引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>可知，<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>都是拟射影（quasi-projective）且固有的（proper）。由引理<REF_0003>和<REF_0004>可知，<MATH_0003>是固有（proper）且拟射影的（quasi-projective）。因此，<MATH_0004>是射影的（projective），见引理<REF_0005>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影的"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影", "context": "首对态射共同具有的第一项性质"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有的", "context": "首对态射共同具有的第二项性质"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有", "context": "所得态射的第一项性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影的", "context": "所得态射的第二项性质"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "运用末条引理得到的结论"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0C4Q:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphisms）。若<MATH_0003>是射影的（projective），且<MATH_0004>是分离的（separated），则<MATH_0005>是射影的（projective）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的源与目标"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理中给定的两个箭头"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "假设中的第一项性质"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的", "context": "假设中的第二项性质"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "引理断言的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0C4Q:proof", "translation": "选取一个闭浸入（closed immersion）<MATH_0001>，其中<MATH_0002>是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的有限型（finite type）<MATH_0003>-模（module）。于是得到一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>。\n此态射（morphism）是闭浸入（closed immersion），因为它是复合（composition）\n<MATH_0005>，\n其中第一个态射（morphism）是闭浸入（closed immersion），依据是《概形（Schemes）》中的引理<REF_0001>（以及<MATH_0006>是分离的（separated）这一事实）；第二个之所以具有同样的性质，是因为它是闭浸入（closed immersion）的基变换（base change）。\n最后，纤维积（fibre product）<MATH_0007>同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0008>，而拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的有限型（finite type）模（modules）在拉回（pullback）后仍属此类。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "首先选取的浸入"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "所给模的第一项性质"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "所给模的第二项性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "给定闭浸入所涉及的模"}, {"s