{"unit_id": "tag:087S:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个具有丰沛（ample）的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）的概形（scheme）。则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 任意射影态射（projective morphism）<MATH_0002>都是H-射影的（projective）；\n<STRUCT_0003> 任意拟射影（quasi-projective）态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>都是H-拟射影的（quasi-projective）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": ["H-"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛", "context": "给定层的相应性质"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "修饰所假设存在的层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "给定概形所具有的对象"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理开头所给的对象"}, {"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射", "context": "第一项结论所涵盖的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "第一项结论 H-射影中的性质词"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影", "context": "第二项结论涵盖的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第二项结论所涉及的箭头"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影的", "context": "第二项结论 H-拟射影中的性质词"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:087S:proof", "translation": "关于<MATH_0001>的假设蕴含<MATH_0002>是拟紧（quasi-compact）且分离的（separated），见《性质（Properties）》中的定义<REF_0001>和引理<REF_0002>，以及《构造（Constructions）》中的引理<REF_0003>。因此可以应用引理<REF_0004>，得到（1）蕴含（2）。\n设<MATH_0003>是有限型（finite type）拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0004>-模（module）。根据我们对射影（projective）态射（morphisms）的定义，只需证明<MATH_0005>是H-射影的（projective）。\n若<MATH_0006>由有限多个全局截面（global sections）生成（generated），则相应的满射（surjection）<MATH_0007>诱导（induces）出所需的闭浸入（closed immersion）\n<MATH_0008>。\n一般地，设<MATH_0009>是<MATH_0010>上的丰沛（ample）的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）。由《性质（Properties）》中的命题<REF_0005>，存在整数（integer）<MATH_0011>，使得\n<MATH_0012>\n由有限多个截面（sections）全局生成（globally generated）。由于<MATH_0013>（见《构造（Constructions）》中的引理<REF_0006>），证明完毕。\n", "allowed_english": ["H-"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "全局截面"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "induces", "target_term": "诱导"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "globally generated", "target_term": "全局生成"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "从概形假设推出的第一项性质"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的", "context": "从概形假设推出的第二项性质"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质", "context": "开头两条引用所在的篇名"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造", "context": "开头第三条引用所在的篇名"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "给定模的有限性条件"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "给定模的凝聚性条件"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "证明中用于构造射影丛的对象"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "所用定义中的性质词"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "该定义所适用的对象"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "待证 H-射影性的性质词"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "全局截面", "context": "特殊情形的生成元"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "全局截面与所给对象的关系"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射", "context": "由全局生成性取得的箭头"}, {"source_term": "induces", "target_term": "诱导", "context": "满射给出闭浸入的关系"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "特殊情形中所需的箭头类型"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛", "context": "一般情形中所取层的性质"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "一般情形中所取层的另一性质"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "一般情形中在指定对象上所取的层"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质", "context": "引用全局生成命题所在的篇名"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数", "context": "由命题取得的参数的类型"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "用于全局生成的一组元素"}, {"source_term": "globally generated", "target_term": "全局生成", "context": "所给对象满足的生成性质"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造", "context": "最后所引引理所在的篇名"}], "notes": []}
